==Spanish==
[[Image:Large bonfire.jpg|thumb|225px|[[fuego]]]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|es|huego||rare, mostly obsolete}}
* {{alt|es|fogo||rare, obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|es|osp|fuego}}, from {{inh|es|LL.|focus||fire}}, from {{inh|es|la|focus||hearth}}. The form {{m|es|huego}}, which began to be used around 1500, was mostly replaced by the form starting with -f-<ref>{{R:es:DCECH}}</ref>. Compare {{cog|pt|fogo}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|fuel}}. Compare also {{cog|en|focus}}. {{doublet|es|foco}}, which is a borrowing from Latin.

